# The prompt contract is hashed into prompt_fingerprint, which decides
# whether two analyses are comparable. prompt_fingerprint normalises line
# endings before hashing, so this file is not what makes the hash correct -
# it keeps working trees consistent so a diff is a real change rather than
# a checkout artefact.
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
